 "ai-fraud-investigation-agent": {
  "kind": "streamlit",
  "upstream_path": "advanced_ai_agents/single_agent_apps/ai_fraud_investigation_agent",
  "entry_file": "advanced_ai_agents/single_agent_apps/ai_fraud_investigation_agent/fraud_investigation_agent.py",
  "page_title": "Surelock Homes — AI Fraud Investigation Agent",
  "title": "🔍 AI Fraud Investigation Agent",
  "texts": [
   {
    "kind": "title",
    "text": "🔍 AI Fraud Investigation Agent",
    "sidebar": false
   },
   {
    "kind": "caption",
    "text": "Autonomous childcare provider fraud investigation using public licensing records, Cook County property data, Google Maps, and Claude via OpenRouter.",
    "sidebar": false
   },
   {
    "kind": "header",
    "text": "Configuration",
    "sidebar": true
   },
   {
    "kind": "markdown",
    "text": "**About:** This is a demo of [Surelock Homes](https://github.com/oso95/Surelock-Homes), an open-source autonomous fraud investigation system for subsidized childcare.",
    "sidebar": true
   },
   {
    "kind": "markdown",
    "text": "**Scope:** Illinois only. Detects physical impossibility and anomalies in licensing records. Does **not** detect attendance fraud (requires non-public CCAP billing data).",
    "sidebar": true
   },
   {
    "kind": "info",
    "text": "Enter your OpenRouter API key in the sidebar and click **Start Investigation** to begin. The agent will search for licensed childcare providers in the ZIP code, cross-reference property records, and narrate its findings in real time.",
    "sidebar": false
   },
   {
    "kind": "markdown",
    "text": "**The agent uses 7 investigation tools:**\n\n| Tool | Source |\n|------|--------|\n| `search_childcare_providers` | Illinois DCFS licensing database |\n| `get_property_data` | Cook County Assessor (Socrata open data) |\n| `calculate_max_capacity` | IL DCFS Part 407 building code math |\n| `get_street_view` | Google Street View API |\n| `get_places_info` | Google Places API |\n| `geocode_address` | Google Maps Geocoding API |\n| `check_business_registration` | IL Secretary of State |\n\n**What it looks for:**\n- Licensed capacity exceeding physical building size (mathematical impossibility)\n- Addresses wher",
    "sidebar": false
   },
   {
    "kind": "markdown",
    "text": "### Investigation: ZIP …",
    "sidebar": false
   },
   {
    "kind": "markdown",
    "text": "*Model: `…`*",
    "sidebar": false
   },
   {
    "kind": "markdown",
    "text": "### Street View Images",
    "sidebar": false
   },
   {
    "kind": "markdown",
    "text": "**…**",
    "sidebar": false
   },
   {
    "kind": "markdown",
    "text": "**Partial results:**",
    "sidebar": false
   }
  ],
  "fields": [
   {
    "kind": "text",
    "widget": "text_input",
    "label": "OpenRouter API Key",
    "sidebar": true,
    "tab": null,
    "help": "Get one at openrouter.ai — free tier available",
    "type": "password",
    "is_api_key": true
   },
   {
    "kind": "text",
    "widget": "text_input",
    "label": "Google Maps API Key",
    "sidebar": true,
    "tab": null,
    "help": "Needs Geocoding, Places, and Street View APIs enabled. Optional — skips visual analysis if omitted.",
    "type": "password",
    "is_api_key": true
   },
   {
    "kind": "select",
    "widget": "selectbox",
    "label": "Model",
    "sidebar": true,
    "tab": null,
    "options": [
     "anthropic/claude-sonnet-4.6",
     "anthropic/claude-opus-4.6",
     "google/gemini-3.1-flash-lite-preview",
     "openai/gpt-5.4",
     "openai/gpt-4o"
    ],
    "index": 0,
    "help": "Claude Sonnet is a good balance of speed and quality",
    "is_api_key": false
   },
   {
    "kind": "select",
    "widget": "selectbox",
    "label": "ZIP Code (Cook County, IL)",
    "sidebar": true,
    "tab": null,
    "help": "Property data is available for Cook County ZIPs only",
    "is_api_key": false
   }
  ],
  "buttons": [
   {
    "label": "🔍 Start Investigation",
    "sidebar": true
   }
  ],
  "tabs": [],
  "outputs": [
   "image"
  ],
  "chat": false,
  "readme_title": "🔍 AI Fraud Investigation Agent",
  "readme_summary": "An AI-powered autonomous fraud investigation agent that cross-references childcare provider licensing records against physical building data to detect anomalies. The agent uses public data — Cook County property records, Illinois DCFS licensing, Google Maps, and the Secretary of State — to find facilities where the physical evidence doesn't match the paperwork."
 },
