 "ripple-change-one-thing-find-what-else-needs-to-change": {
  "kind": "nextjs",
  "upstream_path": "advanced_llm_apps/ripple",
  "readme_title": "Ripple - Change One Thing, Find What Else Needs to Change",
  "readme_summary": "1. Enable Ripple in a Google Doc to capture its current wording as a starting point.\n2. Edit a fact. After you pause, the extension sends the before-and-after wording and the active tab's sentences to the local Ripple backend.\n3. TypeSafe Jev identifies sentences that conflict with the change. Ripple marks them in the document.\n4. Gemini drafts a correction for each flagged sentence, using the changed fact and nearby context. It can suggest a replacement, a removal, keeping the original, or aski"
 },
